chenk oder Jubiläum - hiermit punktest du immer.</span></p><ul style="--text-indent:0;--line-spacing:10px" data-pf-type="List" class="sc-iFMAIt bKYNsx rid-12"><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iqVWFU eVpiLZ pf-126_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC rid-15">3 Moonshines (350ml) in verschiedenen Kombinationen</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iqVWFU eVpiLZ pf-129_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC rid-39">2 Mason Jars Shotgläser + Deckel (5cl)</span></li><li data-pf-type="List.Item" class="sc-iqVWFU eVpiLZ pf-132_"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC rid-42">die beste Moonshine-Ausstattung in schöner Verpackung</span></li></ul><a href="/products/geschenkbox" target="_self" data-pf-type="Button" class="sc-iqseJM fFuGRG rid-58"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC rid-60">Mehr Infos</span></a></div></div></div></div></div><div class="pf-c"><div data-pf-type="ContentListItem" class="sc-feYDSs jrVgaa rid-1"><div class="sc-ezbkAF A-dmbO rid-2 pf-r pf-r-eh" style="--s-xs:15px" data-pf-type="Row"><div class="pf-c" style="--c-xs:12;--c-md:12;--c-lg:12"><div data-pf-type="Column" class="sc-gUQvok iVVDxu rid-3"><a title="8er Micro Moonshine Box" data-action="url" href="/products/8er-micro-box" target="_self" data-pf-type="Image" class="sc-gSQFLo bqvHpa rid-4"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/4859/3539/t/117/assets/micros_8erbox_d_mood_1500-1663146770429.jpg?v=1663146774" srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0326/4859/3539/t/117/assets/micros_8erbox_d_mood_1500-1663146770429.jpg?v=1663146774 1536w" width="1500" height="1500" alt="Wilde Beere O'Donnell Moonshine" title="8er Micro Moonshine Box"/></a><h3 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cTAqQK eHolsa rid-6"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC pf-144_">8er Micro Box</span></h3><h4 data-pf-type="Heading" class="sc-cTAqQK eHolsa rid-7"><span data-pf-type="Text" class="sc-jKTccl dCeBIC pf-147_">für unterwegs und jederze